    - target: {fileID: 2738698598456507154, guid: 1d4ad8111310603419a605972d4f4d41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: My little sister Thelma... she's been missing for a while. We've heard
        rumors of thieves lurking in these parts... maybe they took her? You... seem
        like you can handle yourself in a fight, better than us, anyway. If you come
        across her, please ensure she returns to me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
